# Yocto/bitbake build output: downloads, sstate-cache, tmp/work, etc. This
# tree grows to hundreds of GB / millions of files, so leaving it untracked
# and un-ignored makes any "git status" (including VSCode's own background
# git integration) walk the entire tree on every call -- observed hanging
# for hours and contributing directly to a host-wide memory/disk-I/O crisis
# during a bitbake build.
bitbake-builds/
